    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d502-a1">

                <pb facs="1549" n="1374" sameAs="frus:frus1961-63v10-12mSupp/pg1374"/>


                <p>1. DCI memorandum of 3 November on missile
                    removal.</p>
                <p>2. Instructions of 3 November to Stevenson and McCloy.</p>
                <p>3. Meeting between McCloy and Kuznetsov on 4 November.</p>
                <p>4. Stevenson and McCloy three and one-half hour meeting with
                    Soviets on 6 November.</p>
                <p>5. Five and one-half hour meeting with Soviets in New York on 6 November.</p>
                <p>6. Letter from Khrushchev to Kennedy.</p>
                <p>7. Letter from Kennedy to Khrushchev.</p>
                <p>8. OCI memorandum on the current situation.</p>
                <p>(Documents retained by Mr. Elder)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
